Free Software Foundation (FSF)."""@en ;
        rdfs:range xsd:boolean .

    ns8:isOsiApproved a owl:DatatypeProperty ;
        rdfs:comment """Specifies whether the License is listed as approved by the
Open Source Initiative (OSI)."""@en ;
